{{Navbar-Global Gas Infrastructure Tracker}}
'''Midwestern Gas Transmission''' is a natural gas pipeline that runs bidirectionally from Tennessee to Illinois.<ref name = source1> [https://www.midstreambusiness.com/midwestern-gas-transmission-smaller-size-important-value-209866 "Midwestern Gas Transmission: Smaller In Size, But Important In Value"] Midstream Business accessed January 2018 </ref> 

==Location==
The pipeline runs bidirectionally from Portland, Tennessee to Joliet, Illinois.

